<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 21.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 21.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Latvian state radio's noon news programme. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Latvian citizens can start travelling today without a visa to Iceland.</p>
<p>- German Vereins Bank starts working in Latvia</p>
<p>- French police representatives are in Riga to familiarise themselves with the criminal scene in Latvia.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
